  "presentationLimits": [
    "Use 0/24 for the final saved team; 0/48 aggregates two saved teams.",
    "Training, scripted demonstration, mechanics validation and frozen evaluation must stay visibly separate.",
    "Telemetry contains milestone timestamps and final agent totals, not movement trajectories, video frames or action logs. A timeline is a recorded milestone reconstruction.",
    "Do not call the selected timeline a video, exact replay or live simulation.",
    "Fictional AEGIS employees and concept environments may stage a field call; they are not external eyewitnesses or physical deployments.",
    "The 24-case suite is diagnostic. It does not estimate broad real-world reliability.",
    "Shared rewards and mission rules do not establish a measured causal benefit from cooperation. No matched cooperation baseline has established such a benefit.",
    "The project has no demonstrated transfer to physical robots, logistics, disaster response or other real systems.",
    "The next regrouping and corrective-demonstration experiment is proposed; no new improved team is evidenced in this snapshot.",
    "Current source has navigation assistance and 80 structured observations; do not say the agents learn entirely from scratch or see only raw video."
  ],
